    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "40daa75a-0860-4c53-a641-a1336af7bb0a",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Refreshing Vacation Revenge",
        "Location": "LOCATION_COLORADO",
        "PublicId": "109359112406",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Colorado_2/_scene_bull.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 7d79859c-7b10-4978-8387-199526dc6220).Image",
        "Description": "Agent, we have a major issue. 47 was planning on going to Sapienza to visit the International Gelato Museum, a exhibit based around the delicate art of making gelato. 47 was extremely excited, until 4 lunatics from the United States raided the entire place and stole every artifact from the musuem, including their stash of the best gelato in the world, of which contained over 250 flavors. I ask that you assist 47 by taking a detour to Colorado, where the gelato thieves are located, and eliminating the 4 of them to return peace to the gelato-loving people all over the globe. Best of luck, agent, we're counting on you. ",
